'' See the source's header. UserBinaryOp_ costed both operands through UserConvCost_
'' and took whatever was viable, so an operator over a THIRD type could capture a
'' binary expression whose operands had nothing to do with it.
''
'' The runtime lines are the assertion and build/goldenrun.sh differences them: which
'' operator ran is visible only in what the program prints, not in the IR shape.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/operator-foreign-udt.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
